{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1110310001:2":{"text":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","source_cn":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AC58220F60C0C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1110310001":{"text":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","source_cn":"如果要对付布鲁特斯大人——阿尔萨？喂，阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AC58220F60C0C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110310002:1":{"text":"你这家伙又不肯面对现实了吗？给我出来！","source_cn":"你这家伙又不肯面对现实了吗？给我出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C78EE3702A13351","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110310003:1":{"text":"别拽我别拽我！索恩，你是疯了吗？你是真的想挑战战神布鲁特斯吗？","source_cn":"别拽我别拽我！索恩，你是疯了吗？你是真的想挑战战神布鲁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0A6FAF538A7FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110310004:1":{"text":"你看到他那把大剑砍下来的力道了吧！即使他宽大为怀，留我们两条小命，但咱俩要是残了，谁来保护氏族？","source_cn":"你看到他那把大剑砍下来的力道了吧！即使他宽大为怀，留我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB98F15EAA0BF57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110310005:1":{"text":"你这是什么意思……还没开打，就想着输？","source_cn":"你这是什么意思……还没开打，就想着输？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6293F1ACD0050AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110310006:1":{"text":"我还想问你是什么意思！你莫非觉得你有机会赢？","source_cn":"我还想问你是什么意思！你莫非觉得你有机会赢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EA01778BF79E2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110310007:1":{"text":"所以，你想临阵脱逃？你想放弃和战神做对手的机会？阿尔萨，你忘了和老爹的约定吗？","source_cn":"所以，你想临阵脱逃？你想放弃和战神做对手的机会？阿尔萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA6BD36BB9CC7BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110310008:1":{"text":"老爹将氏族托付给我们，所以，我们要向整片沙漠证明乌尔氏族——","source_cn":"老爹将氏族托付给我们，所以，我们要向整片沙漠证明乌尔氏族——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5190993156D7AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110310009:1":{"text":"你给我清醒点好吗？我们要做的是让乌尔氏族活下来！","source_cn":"你给我清醒点好吗？我们要做的是让乌尔氏族活下来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x307586D272E9CDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110310010:1":{"text":